Viktor 10.10.2026: «По максимуму на картинки контекстное меню».

A right click on a picture (a run's, the gallery's, the stage's, the one over the page) opens the studio's menu: Over the page; To the stage; To the form (its prompt, seed and shape, as the stage's button); All of it to the form (its painter, fine-tune, sampling and adapters as well: Draw paints it again); As reference; Compare…; Set as cover (a square one, with a take in hand); Upscale › 2K, 4K (the sizes they make, with the upscaler the stage's row would take); Star it; Pick it; Copy the prompt; Copy the seed; Download (PNG, its size); The file in a new tab; Its run (the Runs look, its card lit); To the trash. A run developing on the stage has none. Over the page the menu stands over the view and has the keys while it is open: Esc closes the menu, the next Esc the view.

Suite: 615/0 in the kitchen.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>
